
How to use 
load_dbTDFiles.py: 
Use load_dbTDFiles.py -d YYYYMMDD and this will take all the .sql files located in hiveData/Output convert them to .csv and then load them into
influx db server and delete the .sql files

Use backup_loaddbTDFiles.py -d YYYYMMDD -n # and this will run load_dbTDFiles.py for as many nights as you want in a row

See data in influxdb database
influx
show databases
use dbTDFiles
show measurements
select * from WeatherInfo;
select last(*) from WeatherInfo;
select * from DataInfo where "Filename" =~ /2025-02-09/ gets a certian date infor
select count(*) from DataInfo where hvValues1 > 44.0 AND musicpower1 = 1

See sql for query types/influxdb website